# ---------------------------------------------------------------- dataset
# The pipeline reads exactly two files: veriseti/lstm_data.csv and
# veriseti/GNN_DATA.csv. Everything below is an intermediate or a checkpoint
# left over from the original exploratory notebook; stanet/data.py and
# stanet/graph.py regenerate all of it from the two source CSVs.
